From 73ed8c0dfec1058530f147333c42b359a1e2c401 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: will <will-tm@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 15:22:07 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 02/20] hw/arm: add i.MX6SX SoC container

Single Cortex-A9 with the A9 MPCore/PL310 and the boot-relevant i.MX6
peripheral set at 6SX addresses, reusing mainline device models
(imx6 CCM/SRC/SNVS, imx-serial, GPT/EPIT, GPIO, I2C, uSDHC, ChipIdea
USB + PHY, FEC, imx2_wdt). The GPMI NAND subsystem is stubbed for now;
an actual model follows. Unmodeled registers are unimplemented-device
stubs so reads return 0 and writes are dropped.
---
 hw/arm/fsl-imx6sx.c | 564 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 564 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 hw/arm/fsl-imx6sx.c

diff --git a/hw/arm/fsl-imx6sx.c b/hw/arm/fsl-imx6sx.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..20c5585
--- /dev/null
+++ b/hw/arm/fsl-imx6sx.c
@@ -0,0 +1,564 @@
